function chooseIndigolitTarget(unitId?:string,playerTarget?:number){const pending=pendingIndigolit.value;if(!pending)return;if(playerTarget!==undefined){if(!players.value[playerTarget])return;heal(players.value[playerTarget],1)}else{const target=board.value.find(unit=>unit.id===unitId&&!unit.dying&&!unit.flippedTurns&&[0,3].includes(unit.card.Type));if(!target)return;healCreature(target,1,pending.owner)}pending.remaining--;if(pending.remaining){inform(`«Индиголит»: выберите цель для лечения ещё ${pending.remaining} раз.`);return}pendingIndigolit.value=null;note('«Индиголит» завершает пять применений лечения.')}
